stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Plan: Behind copies on this host, batched<br/>(active or not), not BLOCKED
    Plan --> Abort: any preflight check fails
    Plan --> Journal: staged hash == R, geometry matches,<br/>fingerprint known, schema guard ok
    Journal --> Quit: plan.json fsynced<br/>(L_plan, app_was_running)
    Quit --> Abort: app won't exit within timeout
    Quit --> Recheck: app exited
    Recheck --> Reevaluate: L != L_plan, swap aborted,<br/>edit preserved
    Recheck --> Snapshot: L == L_plan for every target
    Snapshot --> Swap: post-quit snapshot verified
    Swap --> Relaunch: atomic renames done
    Relaunch --> Notify: relaunch failed twice
    Relaunch --> Verify: app running and settled
    Verify --> Rollback: mismatch, on_verify_failure = rollback
    Verify --> Kept: mismatch, on_verify_failure = keep
    Rollback --> Blocked: restore every target,<br/>quit / relaunch again
    Blocked --> Notify: BLOCKED(R) until R changes<br/>or resolve / unblock
    Kept --> Notify: B := (R, actual hash), flagged
    Reevaluate --> Notify: relaunch app, the edit is<br/>Ahead or Diverged next tick
    Abort --> Notify: nothing touched, app state restored
    Verify --> Done: re-hash L == R for every target
    Done --> [*]: journal cleared, head then B := R
    Notify --> [*]: journal cleared, logged, deduplicated
